text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_0818589C {
    "Yo, how’s it going, CHAMPION-\nbound {PLAYER}?\pFORTREE GYM LEADER WINONA is a\nmaster of FLYING-type POKéMON.\pShe’s waiting at the back of this GYM,\nbehind the rotating doors.\pShe’s waiting for new challengers who\nare trying to take wing!\pOkay, go for it!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185994 {
    "You did it!\nYou’ve achieved liftoff!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_081859B9 {
    "Behold the elegant battle style of\nBIRD POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_081859EA {
    "You...\nYou’re strong..."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185A02 {
    "A TRAINER has to be smart to keep\nup with unexpected turns of events.\pLet’s see if you have the smarts to\nget to our LEADER?"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185A7F {
    "The lovers of BIRD POKéMON aspire\nto join this GYM.\pAs a member of the FORTREE GYM,\nI’m not allowed to lose!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185AEC {
    "It was too much of a load for me\nto bear..."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185B18 {
    "The world is huge, and there are\ncountless tough TRAINERS.\pI’m going to keep training and make\nmyself even stronger."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185B8D {
    "There’s no need for WINONA, our GYM\nLEADER, to deal with you!\pI’m plenty good enough for you!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185BEB {
    "WINONA, I...\nI lost!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185C00 {
    "WINONA is cute and she’s strong.\nShe’s the ultimate LEADER!\pBlush..."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185C45 {
    "WINONA taught me personally!\nYou can’t beat me easily!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185C7C {
    "I was beaten..."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185C8C {
    "Thanks to WINONA, the people of\nFORTREE can live without fear."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185CCB {
    "I am WINONA. I am the LEADER of the\nFORTREE POKéMON GYM.\pI have become one with BIRD POKéMON\nand have soared the skies...\pHowever grueling the battle, we have\ntriumphed with grace...\pWitness the elegant choreography\nof BIRD POKéMON and I!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185DBA {
    "Never before have I seen a TRAINER\ncommand POKéMON with more grace\lthan I...\pIn recognition of your prowess,\nI present to you this GYM BADGE."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185E48 {
    "{PLAYER} received the FEATHER BADGE\nfrom WINONA."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185E73 {
    "With the FEATHER BADGE, all POKéMON up\nto LV 70, even those received through\ltrades, will obey your every command.\pYou will also be able to use the\nHM move FLY outside of battle.\pAnd this...\nThis is a gift from me."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185F4A {
    "TM40 contains AERIAL ACE.\pIts speed...\nNo POKéMON should be able to avoid it."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185F98 {
    "Though I fell to you, I will remain\ndevoted to BIRD POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185FD5 {
    "FORTREE CITY POKéMON GYM"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M01_Text_08185FEE {
    "FORTREE CITY POKéMON GYM\pWINONA’S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n{PLAYER}"
}
